<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Mortgage Guide (Owner Occupied).</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Mortgage Guide (Owner Occupied).</headline>
<text>
<p>(Updated on February 14)</p>
<p>LENDER		   INTRO  *TRUE   FIXED  FIXED   FIXED</p>
<p>		 VARIABLE RATE   RATE   2 YRS  3 YRS   5 YRS</p>
<p>Adelaide	 8.25   6.40   8.06   7.95    8.15   8.75</p>
<p>Advance	  8.25   6.95   8.16   7.95    8.25   8.70</p>
