<p>BNZ		7.39     -    7.39    -	 -	-</p>
<p>Bank of Melb   8.25   6.95   8.11   7.85    8.15   8.75</p>
<p>Bank of SA     8.25   6.95   8.05   7.95    8.25</p>
<p>*True rate is annual average percentage rate (AAPR). It is the calculated cost of a loan including upfront and ongoing charges and takes into account introductory interest rates and is calculated on a loan size of $100,000.</p>
<p>Note: Where there is more than one product in the category, the lowest rate is quoted.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
